{
  "$schema": "https://open-design.ai/schemas/plugin.v1.json",
  "specVersion": "1.0.0",
  "name": "example-huashu-keynote-black",
  "title": "Keynote Black",
  "title_i18n": {
    "en": "Keynote Black",
    "zh-CN": "黑场大数字"
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Jobs-2007 / Lei-Jun-launch-event keynote decks: pure black #000000 stage, pure white type, one word or one giant tabular-nums numeral per screen, exactly one brand accent (Mi orange #FF6900 / Spotify green #1ED760 / Apple blue #2997FF) per deck, massive negative space, faint center spotlight, accent-vs-grey spec-comparison bars, and a price-reveal climax page on a fixed 1920×1080 canvas. Based on https://github.com/alchaincyf/huashu-design black-big-number-stage (design-styles.md 大胆派「黑底巨型数字剧场」, generated from spec and wrapped in a full multi-section deck shell).",
  "description_i18n": {
    "en": "Jobs-2007 / Lei-Jun-launch-event keynote decks: pure black #000000 stage, pure white type, one word or one giant tabular-nums numeral per screen, exactly one brand accent (Mi orange #FF6900 / Spotify green #1ED760 / Apple blue #2997FF) per deck, massive negative space, faint center spotlight, accent-vs-grey spec-comparison bars, and a price-reveal climax page on a fixed 1920×1080 canvas. Based on https://github.com/alchaincyf/huashu-design black-big-number-stage (design-styles.md 大胆派「黑底巨型数字剧场」, generated from spec and wrapped in a full multi-section deck shell).",
    "zh-CN": "Jobs 2007 / 雷军发布会流派主题演讲幻灯片：纯黑 #000000 舞台 + 纯白文字高反差，一屏一词或一个超大 tabular-nums 数字，整套 deck 只选一个品牌强调色（小米橙 #FF6900 / Spotify 绿 #1ED760 / Apple 蓝 #2997FF），大量负空间、极淡中心聚光、强调色对灰色的参数对比条、价格揭晓高潮页，1920×1080 固定画布。基于花叔 huashu-design design-styles.md 大胆派「黑底巨型数字剧场」spec 现场生成，并扩成完整多章节 deck 外壳。"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": {
    "name": "花叔 (alchaincyf)",
    "url": "https://github.com/alchaincyf"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/alchaincyf/huashu-design",
  "plugin": {
    "repo": "https://github.com/alchaincyf/huashu-design"
  },
  "tags": [
    "community",
    "deck",
    "slides",
    "ppt",
    "presentation",
    "keynote",
    "dark",
    "big-number",
    "huashu"
  ],
  "compat": {
    "agentSkills": [
      {
        "path": "./SKILL.md"
      }
    ]
  },
  "od": {
    "kind": "scenario",
    "taskKind": "new-generation",
    "mode": "deck",
    "scenario": "product",
    "surface": "web",
    "preview": {
      "type": "html",
      "entry": "./example.html",
      "motion": "deck"
    },
    "useCase": {
      "query": {
        "en": "Create a black-stage {{deckType}} for {{audience}} about {{topic}} with {{slideCount}}, using the Keynote Black system (based on huashu-design 黑底巨型数字剧场 / Black Big-Number Stage — Steve Jobs 2007, Lei Jun launch events, Spotify Wrapped, Presentation Zen): a fixed 1920×1080 canvas auto-scaled to the viewport; every page is a pure black #000000 stage with pure white #FFFFFF type at maximum contrast and massive negative space — one idea per screen, never two. Pick exactly ONE brand accent for the whole deck — {{accent}} — and use it for at most one highlight device per page (an accent full stop or single glyph inside a headline, the unit of a giant numeral, the winning comparison bars, one emphasized phrase in a quote); never introduce a second accent, never tint backgrounds. Typography is geometric bold sans only ('Inter'/'Noto Sans SC' stack, weights 700-900) with tight negative tracking; every numeral sits in font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums. Hero pages center one element with flex: either one word + accent full stop (240-300px) or one giant number (320-460px, weight 900) with a small uppercase unit and exactly one quiet caption line underneath; an optional faint center spotlight (radial-gradient white at ≤5% opacity fading to transparent) is the only decoration allowed — no gradients elsewhere, no photos, no emoji, no icon fonts, no shadows, no border-radius except the runtime counter pill. Secondary text uses the locked grey ramp (#9B9B9B captions, #5F5F5F whisper labels, #2A2A2A hairlines, #3A3A3A losing bars). Draw layouts from the locked enumeration: cover / three-things agenda / one-word manifesto / big-number climax / spec-versus comparison (accent bars vs grey bars, right-printed tabular values) / quote / price-reveal (strikethrough expectation above a giant price) / one-more-thing / closing. Build a single self-contained HTML file by copying example.html and replacing content only — keep its design tokens, the spotlight device, the whisper top label, and the navigation script (←/→/Space keys, #/N hash routing, click zones, counter pill) intact. Use the user's real words and numbers, never lorem ipsum or invented data; keep each page to one sentence or less — if a page needs a paragraph, it needs to become two pages; Chinese copy uses 「」 quotes; replace all fictional 曜石/YAO demo content.",
        "zh-CN": "用「黑场大数字」体系为 {{audience}} 做一套关于 {{topic}} 的 {{deckType}}（页数 {{slideCount}}）：1920×1080 固定画布、纯黑 #000000 舞台 + 纯白文字高反差、一屏只讲一件事、大量负空间；整套 deck 只选一个品牌强调色（{{accent}}），每页最多一处高亮（标题里的强调色句号、巨型数字的单位、对比图中获胜的条、引语中的一个短语）；几何粗体无衬线（Inter/思源黑 700-900）+ 收紧字距，所有数字 tabular-nums；版式从封面/三件事目录/一词宣言/大数字高潮/参数对比（强调色条 vs 灰条）/引语/价格揭晓/One more thing/结尾枚举中取用。从 example.html 复制出单文件、只换内容——保留 token、聚光装置、低语顶标和导航脚本；用真实文案与数据、每页一句话以内、替换全部「曜石」演示内容。完整规格以英文版为准（follow the en query above）。"
      },
      "exampleOutputs": [
        {
          "path": "./example.html",
          "title": "Keynote Black",
          "title_i18n": {
            "en": "Keynote Black",
            "zh-CN": "黑场大数字"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "inputs": [
      {
        "name": "deckType",
        "label": "Deck type",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "product launch keynote",
          "thought-leadership talk",
          "all-hands / town hall deck",
          "year-in-review deck",
          "pitch climax deck"
        ],
        "default": "product launch keynote"
      },
      {
        "name": "topic",
        "label": "Topic",
        "type": "string",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "你的主题，例如：新一代随身 AI 终端发布",
        "default": "the user's brief"
      },
      {
        "name": "audience",
        "label": "Audience",
        "type": "string",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "发布会观众 / 全员大会 / 大会听众",
        "default": "a live audience"
      },
      {
        "name": "slideCount",
        "label": "Pages",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "8 pages",
          "9-10 pages",
          "10-11 pages"
        ],
        "default": "9-10 pages"
      },
      {
        "name": "accent",
        "label": "Accent color",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "Mi orange #FF6900",
          "Spotify green #1ED760",
          "Apple blue #2997FF"
        ],
        "default": "Mi orange #FF6900"
      }
    ],
    "context": {
      "skills": [
        {
          "path": "./SKILL.md"
        }
      ],
      "assets": [
        "./example.html"
      ]
    },
    "pipeline": {
      "stages": [
        {
          "id": "discovery",
          "atoms": [
            "discovery-question-form"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "generate",
          "atoms": [
            "file-write",
            "live-artifact"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "capabilities": [
      "prompt:inject",
      "fs:write"
    ]
  }
}
